      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_select_02",
      "hash64": "C406F6299D65BBBC",
      "text": "Comment vous savez ça ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_05",
      "hash64": "EFBD24B47EB49BA8",
      "text": "Hé hé hé ! C’est un petit village, tu sais.\\nLes informations circulent vite.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_06",
      "hash64": "EFBD27B47EB4A0C1",
      "text": "Moi, c’est Lithia ! Je suis globe-trotteuse\\net j’aime bien prendre des photos ![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_07",
      "hash64": "EFBD26B47EB49F0E",
      "text": "Et lui, c’est mon partenaire : Caninos.\\c\\nRegarde comme il est mims avec sa petite corne\\nsur la tête ![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
